"Somebody arriving through this provider is signed in as the account holding the address it gives, so long as the provider says that address is verified. That makes one question worth answering: does this provider only call an address verified when the person proved they hold it? If you run it, almost certainly. If it is somebody else's, check before you rely on it. Set POSTULO_OIDC_LINK_BY_EMAIL to false to require each person to sign in here once and connect the provider from their own account page."
msgstr ""
"Kes tuleb selle teenusepakkuja kaudu, logitakse sisse kontosse, millele antud aadress kuulub, eeldusel et pakkuja ütleb, et aadress on kinnitatud. Seega tasub vastata ühele küsimusele: kas see pakkuja nimetab aadressi kinnitatuks üksnes siis, kui inimene on tõestanud, et see on tema oma? Kui haldate seda ise, siis peaaegu kindlasti. Kui see on kellegi teise oma, kontrollige enne, kui sellele toetute. Määrake POSTULO_OIDC_LINK_BY_EMAIL väärtuseks false, et igaüks peaks siin korra sisse logima ja pakkuja oma konto lehelt ühendama."

